      "text": "About BingX\nFounded in 2018, BingX is a leading crypto exchange and Web3 AI company, serving over 40 million users worldwide. Ranked among the top 5 global crypto derivatives platforms and recognized as a pioneer in crypto copy trading, BingX provides a comprehensive suite of AI-driven products and services, including futures, spot trading, copy trading, and TradFi offerings.\nBingX empowers users across all experience levels with innovative tools designed to enhance trading performance, confidence, and efficiency. As the principal partner of Chelsea FC since 2024 and the first official crypto exchange partner of Scuderia Ferrari HP in 2026, BingX continues to expand its global presence and strengthen its position as a trusted, intelligent trading platform.\nAbout BingX EU\nBingX EU, a prospective MiCA-licensed entity, serves as the independent and strategic European business of BingX and is dedicated to establishing a premier regulated environment for digital asset trading. (BingX EU will commence only after MiCA license is granted.)\nBingX EU current vacancy | Full-time | Long-term | REMOTE\nResponsibilitiesBuild and manage partnerships with affiliates, KOLs, brokers, and trading communities.Drive user acquisition, deposits, trading activity, and revenue growth.Expand regional markets and identify new growth opportunities.Collaborate with internal teams to support the growth of multi-asset trading products and initiatives.\nRequirements3+ years of BD, partnership, affiliate, or sales experience in brokerage, CFD, trading, fintech, or crypto industries.Understanding of CFDs, ETFs, indices, commodities, or other multi-asset trading products.Strong partner network and proven track record of driving business growth.Excellent communication and stakeholder management skills.Fluent in English.\nPreferredExperience at a brokerage, CFD broker, trading platform, fintech company, or crypto exchange.Familiarity with traditional financial markets and trading ecosystems.Additional local language skills are a plus.\nWorking at BingX EUJoin a diverse, international team with a global mindset.Grow your career in a fast-moving Web3 and fintech environment.Work on meaningful products that serve millions of users worldwide.Enjoy competitive compensation and flexible work arrangements, depending on role requirements.Flexibility to observe your local holiday calendar, alongside additional benefits.Please be advised that this recruitment is for a prospective licensed entity; the successful candidate will officially commence their tenure only upon the formal granting of the BingX EU license.",
      "$type": "com.linkedin.pemberly.text.AttributedText"
    },
